<title>JAPAN: CATS Inc to issue 20 mln SFR CB.</title>
<headline>CATS Inc to issue 20 mln SFR CB.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - CATS Inc</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Nomura Bank Switzerland</p>
<p> TYPE convertible     ISSUE NO		AMT   20 million SFR</p>
<p> COUPON		   ISS PRICE	     MATURITY 28.Feb.01</p>
<p> CONV PRICE	     CURR RATE</p>
<p>CONV FROM 14.Oct.96  CONV TO 14.Feb.01</p>
<p> LAST MOODY	     PAY DATE 30.Sep.96  INT PAY end Feb/Aug</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE 12.Sep.96 SUB DATE</p>
<p> LAST JCR		 LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
<p>The coupon, conversion price and currency rate will</p>
<p>be decided on September 12.</p>
</text>
